<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Feb 24/Feb 21    Feb 24/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.21		 3.07</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.11		 2.02</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.17		 4.44</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    2.66		33.06</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.74		20.38</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.74		21.35</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.22		 3.14</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.94		 2.89</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.93		22.49</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.85		22.51</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.06		 4.53</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    3.65		33.43</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
